WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.842
SUPPORTED BY: MINISTRY OF CULTURE,
SPORTS AND TOURISM

00:01.923 --> 00:03.995
AND KOREA CREATIVE
CONTENT AGENCY

00:25.912 --> 00:28.419
LEE SOO-HYUK, ARIN

00:28.886 --> 00:31.439
AND LEE DA-HEE

00:45.104 --> 00:46.275
SOCIAL

00:46.355 --> 00:47.318
SEX

00:47.398 --> 00:49.791
SECRET

00:50.818 --> 00:52.031
SEX LINE

00:52.111 --> 00:54.408
S LINE

00:54.488 --> 00:59.176
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS

01:40.492 --> 01:42.052
I said, get in.

01:47.833 --> 01:50.047
Kang Seon-a, get in.

01:50.127 --> 01:52.813
I told you I'm not getting in!

01:54.757 --> 01:55.928
Seon-a

01:56.008 --> 01:58.151
Ugh, that temper of hers.

02:31.293 --> 02:35.467
MATCHMAKING FOR THE FOREVER ALONE

02:35.547 --> 02:38.817
There are some things
you don't need to see in life.

02:39.260 --> 02:43.321
No. Some things
should not be seen at all.

02:44.723 --> 02:45.769
I've seen these lines
ever since I was born.

02:45.849 --> 02:47.605
- POLITICIAN'S SEXUAL ASSAULT EXPOSED
- I've seen these lines ever since I was born.

02:47.685 --> 02:49.773
Could we just get a statement? Is it true?

02:49.853 --> 02:52.067
- TOP STAR INTERVIEW
- Not at all.

02:52.147 --> 02:54.958
She's special to me,
but we're just manager and actor.

02:56.902 --> 02:59.742
As I grew up, I naturally found out

02:59.822 --> 03:02.077
what those lines meant.

03:02.157 --> 03:04.259
What did you write?

03:05.661 --> 03:09.806
I also discovered I was the only one
who could see these lines.

03:20.592 --> 03:23.806
I was a cursed child who saw
what others couldn't...

03:23.887 --> 03:25.572
DAD, ME, MOM, AUNT

03:27.516 --> 03:31.870
And also a child who made her mom
go insane and who killed her dad.

03:40.487 --> 03:43.244
The red lines that were always there,

03:43.324 --> 03:45.717
slowly began to take meaning.

03:54.710 --> 03:56.298
The moment I realized

03:56.378 --> 03:59.439
that seeing red lines
could kill people...

04:01.884 --> 04:06.321
I shut my mouth and closed my eyes.

04:22.821 --> 04:25.382
I wanted to give up on everything...

04:52.406 --> 04:54.675
but I didn't die.

04:56.727 --> 05:00.038
I survived every time
as if the god was playing with me...

05:01.757 --> 05:04.609
and one day, I became completely alone.

05:09.081 --> 05:11.016
I made a decision then.

05:14.361 --> 05:16.254
If I have no choice but to live,

05:16.755 --> 05:19.357
I needed to find out
why these red lines existed,

05:20.617 --> 05:22.844
who made them,

05:24.171 --> 05:26.940
who else is watching them besides me,

05:27.916 --> 05:33.143
and how I can get rid of them.

05:45.759 --> 05:48.403
Hello? Anyone home?

06:07.406 --> 06:11.968
I moved into the building
across the way a few days ago.

06:12.578 --> 06:14.750
I was going to give out rice cakes
to the neighbours,

06:14.830 --> 06:17.378
but people don't really
eat them nowadays, right?

06:17.458 --> 06:19.755
So I bought some fruit, instead.

06:19.835 --> 06:21.519
Do you like fruit?

06:24.298 --> 06:27.805
I never used to eat fruit
when I was younger,

06:27.885 --> 06:31.363
but now I can never have
enough as an adult.

06:35.392 --> 06:36.647
I'll leave it out here.

06:36.727 --> 06:38.828
Make sure to eat them
before they go bad.

07:58.225 --> 08:01.494
BANGJU POLICE STATION

08:19.746 --> 08:22.015
Damn it.

08:32.551 --> 08:34.014
Hey. I'm sorry.

08:34.094 --> 08:35.265
What?

08:35.345 --> 08:37.322
Never mind. Later.

08:42.019 --> 08:44.370
Don't tell me you left
another scratch on my car.

08:47.941 --> 08:49.667
What's the occasion today?

08:51.028 --> 08:53.088
Why are you here at this hour?

08:53.447 --> 08:55.536
I know, right? It's meaningless...

08:55.616 --> 08:58.247
I was trying to be a good uncle for once.

08:58.327 --> 08:59.957
This is why people shouldn't
try new things.

09:00.037 --> 09:02.263
Oh, that niece in high school?

09:02.581 --> 09:04.420
High schoolers act like royalty nowadays.

09:04.500 --> 09:06.255
So damn royal.

09:06.335 --> 09:08.507
But what can we do?
I'm all that she has.

09:08.587 --> 09:11.314
Then, what happens when you get married?

09:12.049 --> 09:13.733
- "Married?"
- "Married?"

09:24.895 --> 09:28.748
You will come to my wedding, right?

09:36.573 --> 09:38.550
Why would I go to your wedding?

09:39.493 --> 09:41.803
Because we're work colleagues?

09:44.414 --> 09:45.765
What?

09:46.083 --> 09:48.476
Nothing. Just something
came up in my mind.

09:50.504 --> 09:52.856
I thought you were a sex addict.

09:53.131 --> 09:55.275
Isn't it too late for you to be picky?

09:59.263 --> 10:00.905
My bad.

10:17.364 --> 10:20.592
Seon-a, didn't I tell you
to stop acting out?

10:21.994 --> 10:25.346
Why the all they far off

10:26.164 --> 10:28.057
Hey, hand it to me.

10:28.166 --> 10:29.838
Come here.

10:29.918 --> 10:32.174
So I told you not to act up,
didn't I?

10:32.254 --> 10:33.884
Jackass.

10:33.964 --> 10:35.135
Seon-a, are you okay?

10:35.215 --> 10:36.428
Does it hurt?

10:36.508 --> 10:38.818
Stand her up.

10:42.848 --> 10:44.520
Seon-a.

10:44.600 --> 10:46.730
You don't even bring me
the money I ask for.

10:46.810 --> 10:48.912
Then why would you ever report me?

10:49.688 --> 10:51.539
It was you, wasn't it?

10:55.694 --> 10:57.378
Grab her.

10:58.697 --> 11:00.577
My goodness. Seon-a.

11:00.657 --> 11:02.788
Seon-a, you need to get
beaten up some more.

11:02.868 --> 11:03.789
Get up.

11:03.869 --> 11:06.137
Get up! Damn it.

11:08.248 --> 11:09.503
Hey.

11:09.583 --> 11:11.588
I heard that your uncle is a cop.

11:11.668 --> 11:13.215
It's obivous, right?

11:13.295 --> 11:16.272
And why are you ignoring
my calls and texts?

11:26.183 --> 11:28.743
She's so damn heavy.

11:39.529 --> 11:41.130
Did you laugh at me?

11:42.282 --> 11:44.288
If you ever report me again,

11:44.368 --> 11:47.136
I'll actually push you off here.

12:03.929 --> 12:06.030
- Oh, hey.
- Hey.

12:09.976 --> 12:10.814
Victim?

12:10.894 --> 12:14.151
She's a 29-year-old woman living alone.

12:14.231 --> 12:16.737
She worked as a manager
at a nearby cafe.

12:16.817 --> 12:18.530
Family?

12:18.610 --> 12:23.214
No siblings. Parents are still alive,
but they're in the countryside.

12:23.699 --> 12:24.870
Lover?

12:24.950 --> 12:28.219
Nothing confirmed yet.
I'll look into it.

12:38.088 --> 12:42.317
The place is a complete mess,
but all her stuff is here.

12:50.100 --> 12:52.744
The body is clean.

12:54.771 --> 12:57.540
It almost looks like a set for a play.

13:08.827 --> 13:10.428
Oh?

13:12.122 --> 13:13.585
This place is good.

13:13.665 --> 13:15.128
Is it famous?

13:15.208 --> 13:16.893
No.

13:17.252 --> 13:19.645
It's a local spot.

13:23.300 --> 13:24.888
Check it.

13:24.968 --> 13:26.736
Yes, sir.

13:31.349 --> 13:32.688
Detective Han.

13:32.768 --> 13:35.899
We received a statement
from the first floor neighbor earlier.

13:35.979 --> 13:38.068
They saw a man with a helmet on

13:38.148 --> 13:40.696
headed toward this woman's place
late last night.

13:40.776 --> 13:42.155
Helmet?

13:42.235 --> 13:45.046
They said he looked like a deliveryman.

13:45.572 --> 13:47.994
But I just can't figure out

13:48.074 --> 13:51.331
what this punk's goal was.

13:51.411 --> 13:53.333
The money was untouched.

13:53.413 --> 13:55.973
There were no signs of sexual assault.

13:56.208 --> 13:59.685
She doesn't seem like the type
people would have grudges against.

14:00.295 --> 14:02.300
Maybe he's just a psychopath?

14:02.380 --> 14:04.607
Does such a psychopath exist?

14:04.800 --> 14:06.012
How'd it go with the restaurant?

14:06.092 --> 14:08.557
We confirmed she does order
from there frequently,

14:08.637 --> 14:09.891
but she didn't place an order that day.

14:09.971 --> 14:11.393
And what about her love life?

14:11.473 --> 14:12.644
Did you look into it?

14:12.724 --> 14:14.396
They say she did have one,

14:14.476 --> 14:17.662
but apparently,
it ended about a year ago.

14:18.104 --> 14:19.622
Should we look for him?

15:01.606 --> 15:04.542
I JUST ORDERED A BIT TOO MUCH

15:19.332 --> 15:23.006
The corpse of a woman in her 20s was
discovered in her apartment complex

15:23.086 --> 15:25.730
in Sinu-dong with signs
of a strangling this afternoon.

15:25.964 --> 15:29.429
The police have reported
signs of forced entry

15:29.509 --> 15:33.821
and have started investigating this case
as an opportunistic robbery and murder.

15:34.139 --> 15:36.394
With the recent string
of murders in Sinu-dong

15:36.474 --> 15:40.190
involving women in their 30s
who lived alone...

15:40.270 --> 15:43.581
People with hundreds of S lines
are rare and stand out,

15:44.649 --> 15:48.669
but that doesn't mean I miss
the people with just one, either.

15:51.448 --> 15:53.674
Especially if that person is

15:53.992 --> 15:57.011
trying to eavesdrop anything
at a murder scene.

16:21.285 --> 16:23.538
No, I didn't hear anything strange.

16:23.638 --> 16:28.238
Nowadays, deliveries are made
on motorcycles day and night.

16:28.318 --> 16:32.463
Even if you see one roaming,
you just assume someone has ordered food.

17:23.515 --> 17:25.866
112. What's your emergency?

17:28.228 --> 17:31.664
The place across from mine...
The man with the helmet...

17:33.733 --> 17:35.751
Hello?

18:55.178 --> 18:58.059
Today's topic is
equilibriums in ecosystems.

18:58.139 --> 19:02.397
Let's say a grey wolf starts
eating up the livestock in a town.

19:02.477 --> 19:03.940
The residents become mad at the wolf

19:04.020 --> 19:05.775
and ask for permission to hunt the wolf.

19:05.855 --> 19:07.277
Then, what do you think happens?

19:07.357 --> 19:10.209
The wolf will begin to hide its tracks.

19:10.568 --> 19:13.003
So you're just not going to show up?

19:24.207 --> 19:25.975
- What the?
- What is that?

19:26.209 --> 19:29.061
- What could this be?
- Open it.

19:32.131 --> 19:33.899
Clothes?

20:15.216 --> 20:17.151
Jeez, you scared me.

20:17.594 --> 20:19.403
Why didn't you go to school?

20:20.179 --> 20:21.906
Uncle.

20:22.432 --> 20:24.283
Can I have some money?

20:42.744 --> 20:44.123
You can take this for now.

20:44.203 --> 20:46.096
I'll get you some more tomorrow.

20:48.499 --> 20:50.643
How much more can you get me?

21:00.345 --> 21:02.404
Hey, why is your face like this?

21:10.980 --> 21:12.735
Are you getting beaten up out there?

21:12.815 --> 21:14.625
Why do you care?

21:15.193 --> 21:15.905
How much more can you...

21:15.985 --> 21:18.003
Why do you need money?

21:59.862 --> 22:01.326
- Ji-uk.
- Yeah. What?

22:01.406 --> 22:03.578
Listen. Someone made a report yesterday

22:03.658 --> 22:05.830
mentioning a man wearing a helmet.

22:05.910 --> 22:08.958
But the possibility of the suspect being
a deliveryman was never disclosed.

22:09.038 --> 22:10.168
Do you have the caller's location?

22:10.248 --> 22:11.586
Hold on.

22:11.666 --> 22:13.129
Sinu-dong.

22:13.209 --> 22:15.311
Wanseong Apartments, Building B?

22:16.087 --> 22:18.009
Wait, isn't that where you live?

22:18.089 --> 22:19.648
Building B?

22:32.603 --> 22:34.830
BUILDING B

22:42.947 --> 22:45.078
I'm Detective Han Ji-uk
from Bangju Police Station.

22:45.158 --> 22:46.800
Is anyone home?

22:48.327 --> 22:49.123
Wow...

22:49.203 --> 22:51.292
I've never seen someone

22:51.372 --> 22:53.974
with so many S lines
this up close before.

23:07.680 --> 23:09.365
Hello.

23:09.849 --> 23:12.480
You're wasting your time.
She won't come out.

23:12.560 --> 23:14.732
She's famous for being a recluse.

23:14.812 --> 23:17.331
She even has someone throw
her garbage out for her.

23:26.657 --> 23:28.246
I just need a moment of your time.

23:28.326 --> 23:30.039
You made
a police report yesterday, didn't you?

23:30.119 --> 23:33.222
Can you just tell me what you witnessed?

23:35.291 --> 23:37.171
It could serve as crucial evidence

23:37.251 --> 23:40.771
in a murder case
that happened in the vicinity.

23:51.766 --> 23:53.146
A teenager?

23:53.226 --> 23:55.035
Are your parents home?

23:55.186 --> 23:57.329
It was done accidentally.

23:58.815 --> 23:59.777
I'm sorry?

23:59.857 --> 24:02.418
I called 112 by accident.

24:05.655 --> 24:09.508
Can you give me more details
about that situation?

24:10.743 --> 24:14.917
I saw a man with a helmet on walk
into the building across from me

24:14.997 --> 24:17.766
and I thought the woman was in danger.

24:17.959 --> 24:19.922
Woman?

24:20.002 --> 24:22.508
Your next-door neighbor.

24:22.588 --> 24:25.232
The woman who moved into Unit 204.

24:25.883 --> 24:29.027
There's just been
a lot of incidents recently...

24:29.303 --> 24:30.904
But,

24:31.138 --> 24:33.407
it was her boyfriend.

24:35.893 --> 24:37.106
But,

24:37.186 --> 24:38.357
aren't you a teenager?

24:38.437 --> 24:39.997
Shouldn't you be in school?

24:42.441 --> 24:46.003
What the hell's wrong
with the kids nowadays?

24:52.618 --> 24:55.179
But how did she know I lived there?

25:20.938 --> 25:24.166
BUILDING B

26:31.467 --> 26:32.388
KIM-HYE BITCH

26:32.468 --> 26:33.681
I SUGGEST YOU
COME TO SCHOOL TOMORROW.

26:33.761 --> 26:35.404
DON'T FORGET THE MONEY.

26:36.806 --> 26:38.740
ing bitch...

27:29.942 --> 27:31.656
Hurry up.

27:31.736 --> 27:34.296
What's wrong with you?

27:35.906 --> 27:38.467
We just keep going, yeah?

27:40.619 --> 27:42.917
- That's really amazing.
- I know, right?

27:42.997 --> 27:44.835
- Isn't it so freaking nice?
- How much was it?

27:44.915 --> 27:45.920
I didn't buy it this time.

27:46.000 --> 27:47.171
Did your mom buy it?
Or was it your dad?

27:47.251 --> 27:49.715
Don't be an ass.

27:49.795 --> 27:51.396
They passed away.

27:57.845 --> 27:59.446
Ji-uk.

28:00.056 --> 28:03.700
You know that ex-boyfriend of the victim
in the Sinu-dong murder...

28:03.976 --> 28:05.189
His name is Oh Jeong-min.

28:05.269 --> 28:06.774
He's a teacher at Bangju High School.

28:06.854 --> 28:08.567
And his guy's home address is listed

28:08.647 --> 28:12.459
as Unit 303,
Wanseong Apartments Building B.

28:13.611 --> 28:16.450
Don't you think it's strange
he lived so nearby?

28:16.530 --> 28:18.995
And the murder case from last month,

28:19.075 --> 28:21.414
that woman had been going

28:21.494 --> 28:24.333
to the same gym as him up
until a few weeks ago.

28:24.413 --> 28:26.306
What a similarity.

28:27.917 --> 28:29.797
Unit 303, Building B?

28:29.877 --> 28:31.561
Do you have a picture of him?

28:36.133 --> 28:37.179
You're wasting your time.
She won't come out.

28:37.259 --> 28:40.599
She's famous for being a recluse.

28:40.679 --> 28:43.198
She even has someone throw
her garbage out for her.

28:44.558 --> 28:47.064
Unit 303, that bastard.

28:47.144 --> 28:50.163
So he was acquainted
with both murder victims.

28:52.316 --> 28:54.071
Too much to be a coincidence, right?

28:54.151 --> 28:55.836
Right?

28:57.446 --> 29:00.507
And we can't just ignore
such a coincidence.

29:11.335 --> 29:12.936
Hello?

29:16.215 --> 29:17.899
Okay.

29:19.802 --> 29:20.931
Go on ahead without me.

29:21.011 --> 29:22.779
I need to stop by somewhere first.

29:24.723 --> 29:25.519
What?

29:25.599 --> 29:29.077
FATHER

29:45.995 --> 29:47.708
Are you Mr. Han Ho-san's guardian?

29:47.788 --> 29:49.043
One of our new caregivers
just stepped out

29:49.123 --> 29:51.420
for a moment when he disappeared.

29:51.500 --> 29:54.340
We're currently searching
every inch of our facilities.

29:54.420 --> 29:56.605
You must be in shock,
but if you could just wait...

30:15.608 --> 30:17.292
Yeah

30:17.818 --> 30:19.961
Maybe that's…

30:26.827 --> 30:29.250
- Sir!
- Why is he up there?

30:29.330 --> 30:31.210
It's dangerous up there! Come down!

30:31.290 --> 30:33.683
Hurry! Get him!

30:34.126 --> 30:36.520
Come down from there now!

31:06.158 --> 31:08.385
BUILDING B

32:22.526 --> 32:25.086
What the hell is all this?

32:49.970 --> 32:51.780
DONG-SIK

32:52.139 --> 32:53.823
Yeah, I'm on my way.

32:54.183 --> 32:55.521
Ji-uk, this place is weird.

32:55.601 --> 32:56.730
What's weird?

32:56.810 --> 32:58.286
Are you there?

32:59.605 --> 33:01.289
What's weird?

33:02.691 --> 33:03.904
DONG-SIK

33:03.984 --> 33:05.030
Hello?

33:05.110 --> 33:06.378
Dong-sik?

33:06.987 --> 33:08.213
Dong-sik!

33:34.056 --> 33:36.449
DONG-SIK

34:00.124 --> 34:02.475
There's only one left now.

36:32.651 --> 36:35.003
Mom...

37:02.139 --> 37:03.823
Hey.

37:25.287 --> 37:27.305
Jeong-min...

37:28.123 --> 37:29.849
Have you been well?

37:30.250 --> 37:31.851
What are you doing here?

37:43.889 --> 37:45.782
Why...

37:47.893 --> 37:50.495
This is the way to salvation for us all.

37:54.816 --> 37:56.417
Stop.

38:04.201 --> 38:06.177
You're that recluse from downstairs.

38:15.420 --> 38:17.313
So you going to stab me with that?

38:18.924 --> 38:20.566
Go ahead.

38:23.095 --> 38:25.113
Why are you shaking so much?

38:27.349 --> 38:29.117
Go ahead and stab me.

38:31.144 --> 38:32.912
You can't do it?

39:08.656 --> 39:10.674
It's time for salvation.

39:10.991 --> 39:13.093
What a crock of shit.

39:14.662 --> 39:16.513
Where are my glasses?

39:16.664 --> 39:18.085
Where are my damn glasses?

39:18.165 --> 39:20.379
Please stand up! We need to go!

39:20.459 --> 39:21.922
Oh, no. It'll be okay.

39:22.002 --> 39:25.689
- Where are my damn glasses!
- Try to stand up. Come on.

39:26.340 --> 39:29.693
- Where are they?
- Get up. Come on.

39:43.566 --> 39:44.779
Stop it!

39:44.859 --> 39:46.626
Let go of me!

39:54.451 --> 39:56.094
What is all this?

40:09.800 --> 40:12.402
Let go of me!

40:15.764 --> 40:17.199
Hey.

40:31.864 --> 40:34.257
I'll be set once you're gone.

40:34.992 --> 40:36.551
Die.

40:52.801 --> 40:54.778
Die...

41:30.547 --> 41:33.567
The line is disappearing.

42:32.151 --> 42:35.086
The line is disappearing.

42:35.446 --> 42:36.784
Did he see

42:36.864 --> 42:39.549
the S lines like me?

42:40.367 --> 42:42.218
How?

42:46.457 --> 42:48.016
The glasses?

43:17.237 --> 43:19.547
Are you sure you don't want
to go to the hospital?

43:23.494 --> 43:25.679
The man that died...

43:26.705 --> 43:28.223
Who was he?

43:29.917 --> 43:31.672
I'll tell you more later.

43:31.752 --> 43:33.770
You need to stop by the station
at some point anyway.

43:34.254 --> 43:35.772
Uncle.

43:37.049 --> 43:38.095
What's going on?

43:38.175 --> 43:41.027
Why haven't you been
picking up your phone?

43:46.266 --> 43:49.202
What's with the sunglasses
in the middle of the night?

43:53.732 --> 43:55.542
Do you two know each other?

44:04.034 --> 44:05.205
What?

44:05.285 --> 44:06.970
Don't come in if you're not
going to give me money.

44:08.247 --> 44:10.265
Do I look like your ATM or something?

44:20.759 --> 44:24.446
Is something going on at school?

44:26.306 --> 44:28.324
Say something.

44:29.059 --> 44:30.606
Will talking about it change anything?

44:30.686 --> 44:32.691
If there's an issue,
we need to solve it.

44:32.771 --> 44:33.609
Solve it?

44:33.689 --> 44:34.902
How are you going to solve it?

44:34.982 --> 44:36.236
What are you going to solve?

44:36.316 --> 44:39.419
Are you going to pretend to be
my guardian and come with me to school?

44:41.238 --> 44:43.548
You're just going to do this
for a bit before you disappear again.

44:44.741 --> 44:46.121
As if you ever cared for me.
This is bullshit.

44:46.201 --> 44:48.136
Bullshit?

44:48.245 --> 44:50.013
Why you little brat...

44:54.793 --> 44:56.644
Forget it.

44:57.463 --> 44:59.189
But...

45:00.674 --> 45:03.013
why was Hyeon-heup

45:03.093 --> 45:04.932
standing outside of her building?

45:05.012 --> 45:06.946
How do you know her?

45:08.098 --> 45:09.949
The same middle school.

45:10.684 --> 45:13.899
Her mom killed her dad
and ran away when she was a kid.

45:13.979 --> 45:15.580
You didn't know?

45:29.703 --> 45:31.638
Thank you.

45:34.541 --> 45:37.131
For the first time,
I realized there's a chance

45:37.211 --> 45:40.647
my ability to see S lines could
help save people.

45:41.381 --> 45:43.178
If that's true,

45:43.258 --> 45:45.443
what should I do now?

46:22.798 --> 46:27.931
I CAN SEE THE SAME WORLD YOU SEE.

46:28.011 --> 46:33.283
COME TO BANGJU HIGH SCHOOL.

46:41.817 --> 46:48.631
THE GIRL WITH THE SUNGLASSES

47:11.615 --> 47:14.551
Kids, be careful. Don't get hurt.

47:14.660 --> 47:17.416
We have a new student
joining our class today.

47:17.496 --> 47:20.015
Her name is Shin Hyeon-heup.

47:22.209 --> 47:25.771
You can see something
with these on, can't you?

47:26.172 --> 47:27.259
Red lines.

47:27.339 --> 47:30.984
Can you see them, too?

47:32.428 --> 47:33.724
Then, why are you looking at that again?

47:33.804 --> 47:35.447
We already caught the culprit.

47:35.890 --> 47:37.019
Something's sketchy.

47:37.099 --> 47:38.062
What?

47:38.142 --> 47:40.189
I just don't understand
why he killed them at all.

47:40.269 --> 47:42.817
Are you going to hold onto those glasses?

47:42.897 --> 47:44.026
Of course.

47:44.106 --> 47:45.569
Have you lost your mind?

47:45.649 --> 47:48.114
It's time for you to be embarrassed now.

47:48.194 --> 47:49.824
Why would I be embarrassed?

47:49.904 --> 47:50.991
Seon-a.

47:51.071 --> 47:54.370
Even so, violence isn't the answer.

47:54.450 --> 47:56.384
I'm going to kill her.

47:56.994 --> 48:00.430
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS
